{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09366","headline":"至西峰兰若受田妇馈 · 韦应物","name":"至西峰兰若受田妇馈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"攀崖复缘涧，遂造幽人居。\n鸟鸣泉谷暖，土起萌甲舒。\n聊登石楼憩，下翫潭中鱼。\n田妇有嘉献，泼撒新岁余。\n常怪投钱饮，事与贤达疎。\n今我何爲答，鳏寡欲焉如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}